-- Ядро: без проверок режима (docs/MODES.md)
--[[
	Anomaly Coop - bleeding, heal and weakening of Perk-Based Artefacts on the decider (gamedata\scripts\coop_mods_perk_dots.script).
	PBA's Thistle bleeding, Chain's heal of a companion and Ball's weakening, and G.A.M.M.A. Actor Damage Balancer's Thistle
	(momopate_pba_tweaks replaces PBA's at load). The mods' files are not changed.

	PBA's owner callbacks run on the player's machine: his belt decides, his dice roll. Three of its perks then change a
	creature that is not his: change_health and set_health_ex are class Owner (coop_calls.h:308,738) and the engine refuses
	them on a client for another's creature (script_game_object.cpp:153, script_game_object4.cpp:457). Before this file a
	client's Thistle halved his hit but its bleeding hurt nothing, his Chain healed no companion and his Ball kicked a
	creature that had not been weakened first.
	Remote Thistle on stalkers in G.A.M.M.A. is pending: grok_bo replaces PBA's callback and runs PBA_obh on the map authority.
	That path still needs the shooter's belt. The co-op host's own stalker hits can use the wrapped PBA table.

	Who decides, per mode (nothing here asks which mode it is; the requests are coop_mods_perk_abilities' commands, mods.pba_cmd):
	  Co-op:  the host's process leads the map (bodies, AI, inventories, companions) and applies every player's request.
	          The host's own player's bleeding and heal call the same decider function directly (coop_mods_perk_abilities.cmd
	          does that, from = his own peer). His Ball is the mod's own call: the creature is the host's object already.
	  Server: the map server of the player's level applies them (his machine -> the world server -> that map server,
	          core.on(..., "host")). The world server has no map and applies nothing. Players on two maps reach
	          each their own map server; a bleeding lives on the map server that ticks it.

	Commands (kinds of mods.pba_cmd, coop_mods_perk_abilities; its checks run first: shape, once, his character, his
	artefact, the target, range, floor, rate). Kind keys:
	  bleed  t = the creature, b = the loss per tick (> 0, the mod's own number), d = seconds, s = procs merged (1..16)
	         The owner: the mod's Thistle (PBA's or Momopate's, whichever artefact_props.af_repei is) runs on his hit as
	         before (the halved hit, the proc's dice, sound and particles stay his); the timed effect it would add is taken
	         instead (its target and bleeding_hit are the effect's own upvalues) and asked for. Procs within 0.5 s of the
	         last request are merged. A batch reaching 16 procs goes as soon as 250 ms have passed since the last request
	         (the shared verb's budget: 4 a second). Further procs start a separate batch.
	         The decider (checks: pba_bleed_shape guard, pba_bleed_duration trust, pba_bleed_dots guard, pba_bleed_hit guard,
	         pba_bleed_amount trust): d up to the active Thistle's effect_time (Momopate 3.5 s, PBA 7 s), cut to it in every
	         mode; at most 24 bleedings of one player at once, running or waiting.
	         A bleeding is tied to his own hits. The decider keeps a book of the hits it applies for players (its
	         npc_on_before_hit / monster_on_before_hit with a player's character as the draftsman: a client's forwarded hit,
	         coop_requests.cpp host_hit, or the host player's own): creature, power (at most 50, grok_bo's own bound for a
	         bullet), time; 512 a character, for 15 s. A bleeding needs his unspent hits of that creature from the last 15 s, an
	         always-on guard (his machine holds a proc up to 0.5 s for each creature waiting before it, oldest first: 24
	         bleedings at once wait up to 12 s, plus the transport). A request that comes
	         before its hit (his frame sends the hit first, the decider may apply it a frame later, the world server relays
	         both) waits for it up to 1 s, then is dropped. s is cut to those hits; b to the mod's own amount for their power
	         before his Thistle halved it (power / hit_coeff * the loss a tick per power for his verified count), times 2 for
	         the other perks' changes of the power on either machine (the order of the callbacks is not fixed), cut to it in
	         every mode. The hits a bleeding used are spent. A tick every 100 ms, floor(d * 10 + 0.5) + 1 of them, as the mod's
	         100 ms loop runs an effect up to the cycle after its end; a dead or missing target ends it. The tick that would
	         kill is npc:kill(his character) while that character is his and here (the kill is his: perks, tasks,
	         statistics), else the mod's own change_health (the engine credits the last hitter); an invulnerable creature
	         only gets the change.
	  chain  m = Chain ticks (100 ms each) since the last request
	         The owner: the mod's Chain runs every 100 ms as before (his own heal and power stay his) with the stock companion
	         table empty for that call; a tick of the Chain's community is counted, and the count goes every 2 s.
	         The decider (pba_chain_shape guard, pba_chain_community and pba_chain_ticks trust): his character's community
	         matches the Chain's, including the NPC form of his faction; m up to the time since his last heal (2.5 s at most),
	         cut to it in every mode. The weakest living companion below full health gets 0.0015 a tick if owned by his
	         character and of the Chain's companion community. Candidates come from the stock list and ordinary squad members.
	  ball   t = the creature
	         The owner: the mod's Ball runs as before (target choice, cooldown, the fly of the body on his copy); its target is
	         the one the mod names in add_cooldown(IsStalker(target) ...) after it made its hit (PBA :4108, :4166). His own
	         kick of that creature is held back at the frame's end (his before-hit chain: flags.ret_value = false), so only
	         the decider kicks. The decider (pba_ball_kind trust: a monster of his Ball's tiers for his verified count, as the
	         mod's own list) weakens a living, vulnerable monster to 0.01, then hits from his character (power = the section's
	         Health * 0.01, wound, impulse 10000, bone bip01_spine, the throw along his line to it, weapon = his character as
	         the engine names a weaponless hit).
	Network text never becomes a format string or a log line; ids and numbers are checked before they are used.

	No saved state. No new event (the kinds above travel in mods.pba_cmd).
--]]

local api = rawget(_G, "coop") -- engine namespace, nil on an exe without co-op

local type, pairs, ipairs, pcall, tostring, tonumber, next, setmetatable, rawget, rawset =
	type, pairs, ipairs, pcall, tostring, tonumber, next, setmetatable, rawget, rawset
local math_floor, math_min, math_sqrt, math_huge, math_random = math.floor, math.min, math.sqrt, math.huge, math.random

local core = coop_mods_core
local function log(fmt, ...) core.log("perk_dots", fmt, ...) end
local function PBA() return core.mod("perk_based_artefacts") end

local TICK_MS = 100 -- PBA's actor_on_update runs its effects every 100 ms (perk_based_artefacts.script:120,4522-4531)
local PBA_THISTLE_S = 7 -- PBA's own af_repei.effect_time, when the active Thistle has none
local HIT_CAP = 50 -- grok_bo: a hit of 50 or more is no bullet (monster_on_before_hit `if shit.power >= 50 then return end`)
local MAX_STACK = 16 -- procs one request may merge
local MAX_DOTS = 24 -- bleedings of one player at once
local BLEED_GAP_MS = 500 -- normal interval for a partial batch
local BLEED_MIN_MS = 250 -- minimum interval for a full batch and the decider's rate check
local BLEED_RANGE = 1500 -- the engine's own range for a player's bullet (coop_requests.cpp kFireRange)
local HIT_KEEP_MS = 15000 -- a hit of his counts for a bleeding this long, at least MAX_DOTS *
                          -- BLEED_GAP_MS + transport (his machine sends one creature's batch every 0.5 s, oldest first)
local HIT_WAIT_MS = 1000 -- a bleeding asked before the decider applied its hit waits for it this long
local MAX_HITS = 512 -- hits kept per player character
local HIT_SLACK = 2 -- other perks may change his hit's power before or after the book sees it
local CHAIN_MS = 2000 -- the owner tells his Chain ticks this often
local CHAIN_HEAL = 0.0015 -- PBA af_chelust: heal_companion:change_health(0.0015) a tick (perk_based_artefacts.script:2833)
local MAX_CHAIN_TICKS = 25
local BALL_RANGE = 8 -- metres: the mod kicks within 2.7 m (af_ball.scan_radius); slack for movement and latency
local BALL_WEAK = 0.01 -- PBA af_ball: target:set_health_ex(0.01) before its hit (perk_based_artefacts.script:4123)
local BALL_IMPULSE = 10000 -- PBA af_ball: h.impulse = 10000
local BALL_MARK_MS = 1000
local SWEEP_MS = 1000
local TIMERS = { "add_simple_timed_effect", "s_event" } -- PBA's function and Momopate's alias of it (momopate_pba_tweaks.script:4)

local st = { bleeds_out = 0, bleeds = 0, ticks = 0, kills = 0, heals_out = 0, heals = 0, heals_none = 0, kicks_out = 0,
	kicks_held = 0, kicks = 0, refused = 0, no_hit = 0 }
local abil = nil -- coop_mods_perk_abilities: cmd / serve

local function whole(v, lo, hi)
	return type(v) == "number" and v == v and v >= lo and v <= hi and v == math_floor(v)
end

local function positive(v)
	return type(v) == "number" and v == v and v > 0 and v < math_huge
end

local function props_of(name)
	local pba = PBA()
	local all = pba and pba.artefact_props
	local p = type(all) == "table" and all[name] or nil
	return type(p) == "table" and p or nil
end

local function refused()
	st.refused = st.refused + 1
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The decider: bleeding (PBA's Thistle, Momopate's Thistle)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
local dots = {} -- { peer, owner = his character id, target = creature id, b = loss a tick, left = ticks, next_at }
local hits = {} -- player's character id -> his hits applied here, oldest first: { target, power, at, used }
local waiting = {} -- bleedings asked before their hit: { peer, owner, target, b, s, d, count, till }

-- The decider's book: a hit this process applies whose draftsman is a player's character (a client's forwarded hit, the
-- host player's own). npc_on_before_hit / monster_on_before_hit; the hit itself is not changed.
local function note_hit(victim, s_hit)
	if victim == nil or s_hit == nil or not core.active() then return end
	local ok, who, target, power = pcall(function() return s_hit.draftsman:id(), victim:id(), s_hit.power end)
	if not (ok and whole(who, 0, 65534) and whole(target, 1, 65534) and who ~= target and positive(power)) then return end
	if not (core.is_player(who) and coop_mode.leads_here()) then return end
	local list = hits[who]
	if not list then
		list = {}
		hits[who] = list
	end
	local now = time_global()
	while list[1] and (list[1].used or now - list[1].at > HIT_KEEP_MS or #list >= MAX_HITS) do table.remove(list, 1) end
	list[#list + 1] = { target = target, power = math_min(power, HIT_CAP), at = now }
end

-- His unspent hits of the creature from the last HIT_KEEP_MS, oldest first.
local function hits_on(owner, target, now)
	local out = {}
	local list = hits[owner]
	if not list then return out end
	for _, h in ipairs(list) do
		if not h.used and h.target == target and now - h.at <= HIT_KEEP_MS then out[#out + 1] = h end
	end
	return out
end

-- The loss a tick of one proc at a hit power of 1, by the active Thistle's own numbers on this process.
local function tick_coeff(props, n)
	if not props then return 0 end
	n = math_min(n or 1, 5)
	if type(props.g_bleed) == "table" then
		-- Momopate: s_hit.power * hit_coeff (:458), then * -g_bleed[count] * 0.75 (:456, :472)
		return (tonumber(props.hit_coeff) or 1) * (tonumber(props.g_bleed[n]) or 0) * 0.75
	end
	-- PBA: s_hit.power * -bleed_coeff * artefact_count (perk_based_artefacts.script:1614)
	return (tonumber(props.bleed_coeff) or 0) * n
end

-- A bleeding w against his hits. False: none yet and it may still wait; true: applied or refused.
local function bleed_settle(w, now, last)
	local mine = hits_on(w.owner, w.target, now)
	if mine[1] == nil and not last then return false end
	if not coop_trust.guard("pba_bleed_hit", mine[1] ~= nil, "player #%d: a bleeding of a creature he has not hit", w.peer) then
		st.no_hit = st.no_hit + 1
		refused()
		return true
	end
	local props = props_of("af_repei")
	local hc = props and tonumber(props.hit_coeff)
	if not positive(hc) then hc = 1 end
	local k = math_min(w.s, #mine)
	local power = 0
	for i = 1, k do power = power + mine[i].power end
	local cap = power / hc * tick_coeff(props, w.count) * HIT_SLACK
	if w.peer == core.self_peer() and coop_mode.actor_is_player() and w.b > cap then
		cap = w.b -- the decider's own player (the co-op host): his chain ran here (grok_bo hands PBA its own power, rv_integA N2)
	end
	if not positive(cap) then -- no Thistle known here
		refused()
		return true
	end
	if not coop_trust.pass("pba_bleed_amount", w.b <= cap, "player #%d: a bleeding over the mod's own for his hits", w.peer) then
		refused()
		return true
	end
	for i = 1, k do mine[i].used = true end
	dots[#dots + 1] = { peer = w.peer, owner = w.owner, target = w.target, b = math_min(w.b, cap),
		left = math_floor(w.d * 10 + 0.5) + 1, next_at = now + TICK_MS }
	st.bleeds = st.bleeds + 1
	return true
end

local function bleed_apply(r)
	local t = r.t
	if not coop_trust.guard("pba_bleed_shape", positive(t.b) and (t.s == nil or whole(t.s, 1, 255)),
		"player #%d: a malformed bleeding", r.from) then
		return refused()
	end
	local props = props_of("af_repei")
	local bound = props and tonumber(props.effect_time)
	if not positive(bound) then bound = PBA_THISTLE_S end
	if not coop_trust.pass("pba_bleed_duration", t.d == nil or t.d <= bound, "player #%d: a bleeding longer than the mod's",
		r.from) then
		return refused()
	end
	if tick_coeff(props, r.count) <= 0 then return refused() end -- no Thistle known here
	local n = 0
	for _, dot in ipairs(dots) do
		if dot.peer == r.from then n = n + 1 end
	end
	for _, w in ipairs(waiting) do
		if w.peer == r.from then n = n + 1 end
	end
	if not coop_trust.guard("pba_bleed_dots", n < MAX_DOTS, "player #%d: too many bleedings at once", r.from) then
		return refused()
	end
	local now = time_global()
	local w = { peer = r.from, owner = r.owner:id(), target = r.target:id(), b = t.b, s = math_min(t.s or 1, MAX_STACK),
		d = math_min(t.d or bound, bound), count = r.count, till = now + HIT_WAIT_MS }
	if not bleed_settle(w, now, false) then waiting[#waiting + 1] = w end
end

-- The bleedings that wait for their hit: settled once the hit is in the book, dropped after HIT_WAIT_MS.
local function settle_waiting(now)
	local i = 1
	while i <= #waiting do
		local w = waiting[i]
		local ok, done = pcall(bleed_settle, w, now, now >= w.till)
		if not ok then core.report("perk_dots", "bleeding wait", done) end
		if ok and not done then
			i = i + 1
		else
			table.remove(waiting, i)
		end
	end
end

local function invulnerable(obj)
	local ok, v = pcall(function() return obj:invulnerable() end)
	return ok and v == true
end

-- One run of the mod's effect: if not npc:alive() then return end npc:change_health(bleeding_hit). False: it is over.
local function bleed_tick(dot)
	local npc = level.object_by_id(dot.target)
	if not (npc and npc:alive()) then return false end
	local health = npc.health
	if type(health) == "number" and health - dot.b <= 0 and not invulnerable(npc) then
		local who = level.object_by_id(dot.owner)
		if who and core.peer_of(dot.owner) == dot.peer then
			npc:kill(who)
			st.kills = st.kills + 1
			return false
		end
	end
	npc:change_health(-dot.b)
	st.ticks = st.ticks + 1
	return true
end

local function tick_dots(now)
	local i = 1
	while i <= #dots do
		local dot = dots[i]
		local live = true
		while live and dot.left > 0 and now >= dot.next_at do
			local ok, more = pcall(bleed_tick, dot)
			if not ok then core.report("perk_dots", "bleeding tick", more) end
			live = ok and more == true
			dot.left = dot.left - 1
			dot.next_at = dot.next_at + TICK_MS
		end
		if live and dot.left > 0 then
			i = i + 1
		else
			table.remove(dots, i)
		end
	end
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The decider: the Chain's heal of a companion
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
local chain_at = {} -- peer -> time_global() of his last accepted heal

-- Same marks as the companions' hire count for ordinary members outside the stock list.
local function ordinary_companion(id)
	local se = alife_object(id)
	if not se then return false end
	local name = se:name()
	return se_load_var(id, name, "companion") == true and not se_load_var(id, name, "companion_cannot_dismiss")
end

-- The mod's choice (perk_based_artefacts.script:2806-2826) among HIS companions on this map.
local function his_weakest(owner, props)
	local ax = axr_companions
	local cc = core.mod("coop_npc_companions")
	local whose = cc and core.fn(cc, "owner_character")
	local valid = props.valid_companion_communities
	if type(ax) ~= "table" or not whose or type(valid) ~= "table" then return nil end
	local list, squads = ax.non_task_companions, ax.companion_squads
	if type(list) ~= "table" then list = {} end
	local oid = owner:id()
	local best, low = nil, 1
	local function consider(id)
		local obj = type(id) == "number" and level.object_by_id(id) or nil
		if obj and obj:alive() then
			local ok, comm, health, leader = pcall(function() return obj:character_community(), obj.health, whose(obj) end)
			if ok and valid[comm] and leader == oid and type(health) == "number" and health < low then
				best, low = obj, health
			end
		end
	end
	for id in pairs(list) do consider(id) end
	if type(squads) == "table" then
		for _, squad in pairs(squads) do
			local ok, e = pcall(function()
				for member in squad:squad_members() do
					local id = member.id
					if list[id] == nil and ordinary_companion(id) then consider(id) end
				end
			end)
			if not ok then core.report("perk_dots", "Chain squad members", e) end
		end
	end
	return best
end

local function chain_apply(r)
	local t = r.t
	if not coop_trust.guard("pba_chain_shape", whole(t.m, 1, 65535), "player #%d: a malformed heal", r.from) then
		return refused()
	end
	local props = props_of("af_chelust")
	if not props then return refused() end
	local okc, comm = pcall(function() return r.owner:character_community() end)
	local valid = props.valid_communities
	local member = okc and type(valid) == "table" and type(comm) == "string"
		and (valid[comm] == true or (comm:sub(1, 6) ~= "actor_" and valid["actor_" .. comm] == true))
	if not coop_trust.pass("pba_chain_community", member, "player #%d: his character is not of the Chain's community", r.from) then
		return refused()
	end
	local now = time_global()
	local was = chain_at[r.from]
	local bound = was and math_min(MAX_CHAIN_TICKS, math_floor((now - was) / TICK_MS) + 2) or MAX_CHAIN_TICKS
	if not coop_trust.pass("pba_chain_ticks", t.m <= bound, "player #%d: more Chain ticks than time passed", r.from) then
		return refused()
	end
	chain_at[r.from] = now
	local mate = his_weakest(r.owner, props)
	if not mate then
		st.heals_none = st.heals_none + 1
		return
	end
	mate:change_health(CHAIN_HEAL * math_min(t.m, bound))
	st.heals = st.heals + 1
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The decider: the Ball's weakening and kick
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The mod's own list (artefact_on_equip_functions.af_ball, tiers 1..count; the kick's checks at :3998-4008).
local function ball_allows(props, obj, n)
	if not IsMonster(obj) then return false end
	local tiers = props.monster_tiers
	if type(tiers) ~= "table" then return false end
	local allowed = {}
	for i = 1, math_min(n, 5) do
		if type(tiers[i]) == "table" then
			for _, m in ipairs(tiers[i]) do allowed[m] = true end
		end
	end
	local sec = obj:section()
	local cls = (sec == "gigant_jumper" and clsid.pseudo_gigant) or obj:clsid()
	return allowed[cls] == true or allowed[SYS_GetParam(2, sec, "kind", "definitely_not_found_kind")] == true
		or allowed[SYS_GetParam(0, sec, "kind", 0)] == true
end

local function ball_apply(r)
	local props = props_of("af_ball")
	if not props then return refused() end
	local target, owner = r.target, r.owner
	local ok, fits = pcall(ball_allows, props, target, r.count)
	if not coop_trust.pass("pba_ball_kind", ok and fits == true, "player #%d: his Ball does not kick this creature", r.from) then
		return refused()
	end
	if not IsMonster(target) or not target:alive() or invulnerable(target) then return refused() end
	-- PBA artefact_on_key_press_functions.af_ball (perk_based_artefacts.script:4103-4126), here on the creature itself
	local health = ini_sys:r_float_ex(target:section(), "Health") or 100
	local tp, op = target:position(), owner:position()
	local dx, dz = tp.x - op.x, tp.z - op.z
	local len = math_sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz)
	if len < 0.01 then dx, dz, len = 0, 1, 1 end
	local magnitude = r.count * 60
	local h = hit()
	h.power = health * 0.01
	h.direction = vector():set(dx / len * 1000 * magnitude, (0.1 + math_random() * 0.1) * 5000 * magnitude,
		dz / len * 1000 * magnitude)
	h.bone = "bip01_spine"
	h.draftsman = owner
	h.impulse = BALL_IMPULSE
	h.type = hit.wound
	h.weapon_id = owner:id() -- a weaponless hit of a player names his character (coop_requests.cpp host_hit)
	target:set_health_ex(BALL_WEAK)
	target:hit(h)
	st.kicks = st.kicks + 1
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The owner
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
local pending = {} -- local creature id -> partial batch { id, b, s, d, ids, n, at }
local full_bleeds = {} -- batches sealed at MAX_STACK, in order of completion
local bleed_sent_at = 0
local chain_st = { ticks = 0, ids = nil, n = 1, sent_at = 0 }
local ball_mark = {} -- local creature id -> time_global() until his own kick of it is held back here

-- The mod's bleeding effect (PBA :1617-1621, Momopate :474-486): its amount a tick and its creature.
local function bleeding_of(f)
	if type(f) ~= "function" then return nil end
	local b = core.upvalue(f, "bleeding_hit")
	local npc, holder = core.upvalue(f, "npc")
	if type(b) ~= "number" or b ~= b or not holder or npc == nil then return nil end
	return b, npc
end

-- Runs f with PBA's timed-effect function (and Momopate's alias) taking the bleeding effects into `caught`.
local function with_capture(caught, f, ...)
	local swapped = {}
	for _, name in ipairs({ "perk_based_artefacts", "momopate_pba_tweaks" }) do
		local m = core.mod(name)
		for _, key in ipairs(TIMERS) do
			local real = type(m) == "table" and rawget(m, key) or nil
			if type(real) == "function" then
				swapped[#swapped + 1] = { m, key, real }
				m[key] = function(timer, effect, on_end, k, ...)
					if on_end == nil and k == nil then
						local b, npc = bleeding_of(effect)
						if b then
							caught[#caught + 1] = { b = b, npc = npc, d = timer }
							return
						end
					end
					return real(timer, effect, on_end, k, ...)
				end
			end
		end
	end
	local ok, e = pcall(f, ...)
	for i = #swapped, 1, -1 do
		local s = swapped[i]
		s[1][s[2]] = s[3]
	end
	return ok, e
end

local function bleed_flush(now)
	local elapsed = now - bleed_sent_at
	local p = full_bleeds[1]
	if p then
		if elapsed < BLEED_MIN_MS then return end
		table.remove(full_bleeds, 1)
	else
		if elapsed < BLEED_GAP_MS then return end
		for _, batch in pairs(pending) do
			if not p or batch.at < p.at then p = batch end
		end
		if not p then return end
		pending[p.id] = nil
	end
	local obj = level.object_by_id(p.id)
	if not (obj and obj:alive()) then return end -- it died meanwhile: nothing left to bleed
	if abil.cmd("bleed", p.id, { ids = p.ids, n = p.n, d = p.d > 0 and p.d or nil, b = p.b, s = p.s }) then
		bleed_sent_at = now
		st.bleeds_out = st.bleeds_out + 1
	end
end

local function thistle(orig)
	return function(actor, count, ids, names, victim, s_hit, ...)
		if not (core.active() and coop_mode.actor_is_player()) then return orig(actor, count, ids, names, victim, s_hit, ...) end
		local caught = {}
		local ok, e = with_capture(caught, orig, actor, count, ids, names, victim, s_hit, ...)
		if not ok then core.report("perk_dots", "Thistle", e) end
		local now = time_global()
		for _, c in ipairs(caught) do
			local okid, id = pcall(function() return c.npc:id() end)
			if okid and type(id) == "number" and c.b < 0 then
				local p = pending[id]
				if not p then
					p = { id = id, b = 0, s = 0, d = 0, at = now }
					pending[id] = p
				end
				p.b, p.s = p.b - c.b, p.s + 1
				if type(c.d) == "number" and c.d > p.d then p.d = c.d end
				p.ids, p.n = ids, count
				if p.s == MAX_STACK then
					pending[id] = nil
					full_bleeds[#full_bleeds + 1] = p
				end
			end
		end
		bleed_flush(now)
	end
end

local function chain_flush(now)
	if chain_st.ticks <= 0 or now - chain_st.sent_at < CHAIN_MS then return end
	local m = chain_st.ticks
	chain_st.ticks, chain_st.sent_at = 0, now
	if abil.cmd("chain", 0, { ids = chain_st.ids, n = chain_st.n, m = m }) then st.heals_out = st.heals_out + 1 end
end

local function chain(orig)
	return function(actor, count, ids, names, ...)
		if not (core.active() and coop_mode.actor_is_player()) then return orig(actor, count, ids, names, ...) end
		-- the mod heals the weakest companion of the stock table where it runs (:2806-2833): empty for this call
		local ax = axr_companions
		local list = nil
		if type(ax) == "table" then
			list = ax.non_task_companions -- a client's may be false: it comes back as it was
			ax.non_task_companions = {}
		end
		local ok, e = pcall(orig, actor, count, ids, names, ...)
		if type(ax) == "table" then ax.non_task_companions = list end
		if not ok then core.report("perk_dots", "Chain", e) end
		local props = props_of("af_chelust")
		local okc, comm = pcall(function() return actor:character_community() end)
		if okc and props and type(props.valid_communities) == "table" and props.valid_communities[comm] then
			chain_st.ticks = math_min(chain_st.ticks + 1, MAX_CHAIN_TICKS)
			chain_st.ids, chain_st.n = ids, count
			chain_flush(time_global())
		end
	end
end

local function ball(orig)
	return function(actor, count, ids, names, key, ...)
		-- the process that leads the map owns the creature: the mod's own weakening and kick act on it there
		if not (core.active() and coop_mode.actor_is_player()) or coop_mode.leads_here() then
			return orig(actor, count, ids, names, key, ...)
		end
		local pba = PBA()
		local made, target = false, nil
		local real_hit, real_is = hit, IsStalker
		local had_hit, had_is = rawget(pba, "hit"), rawget(pba, "IsStalker")
		rawset(pba, "hit", setmetatable({}, {
			__index = function(_, k) return real_hit[k] end,
			__call = function(_, ...)
				made = true
				return real_hit(...)
			end,
		}))
		rawset(pba, "IsStalker", function(o, ...)
			if made then target = o end
			return real_is(o, ...)
		end)
		local ok, e = pcall(orig, actor, count, ids, names, key, ...)
		rawset(pba, "hit", had_hit)
		rawset(pba, "IsStalker", had_is)
		if not ok then core.report("perk_dots", "Ball", e) end
		if target == nil then return end
		local okid, id = pcall(function() return target:id() end)
		if not (okid and type(id) == "number") then return end
		if abil.cmd("ball", id, { ids = ids, n = count }) then
			ball_mark[id] = time_global() + BALL_MARK_MS
			st.kicks_out = st.kicks_out + 1
		end
	end
end

-- His before-hit chain at the frame's end (coop_requests.cpp client_hit_perks): his own kick of a creature the decider kicks
-- does not go.
local function own_kick(victim, s_hit, bone_id, flags)
	if next(ball_mark) == nil or victim == nil or s_hit == nil or type(flags) ~= "table" then return end
	local ok, id, mine = pcall(function()
		return victim:id(), s_hit.draftsman:id() == db.actor:id() and s_hit.type == hit.wound
			and (tonumber(s_hit.impulse) or 0) >= BALL_IMPULSE / 2
	end)
	local till = ok and ball_mark[id]
	if not till then return end
	if time_global() > till then
		ball_mark[id] = nil
		return
	end
	if mine and coop_mode.actor_is_player() then
		ball_mark[id] = nil
		flags.ret_value = false
		st.kicks_held = st.kicks_held + 1
	end
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Start
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
local function sweep(now)
	if not core.active() then
		dots, chain_at, pending, full_bleeds, ball_mark, hits, waiting = {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}
		chain_st.ticks = 0
		return
	end
	for who, list in pairs(hits) do
		local newest = list[#list]
		if not newest or now - newest.at > HIT_KEEP_MS then hits[who] = nil end
	end
	local present = { [core.self_peer()] = true }
	for _, p in ipairs(core.players()) do
		if type(p.id) == "number" then present[p.id] = true end
	end
	for peer in pairs(chain_at) do
		if not present[peer] then chain_at[peer] = nil end
	end
	for id, till in pairs(ball_mark) do
		if now > till then ball_mark[id] = nil end
	end
end

local next_sweep = 0
local function update()
	local now = time_global()
	if core.active() then
		if full_bleeds[1] or next(pending) ~= nil then
			local ok, e = pcall(bleed_flush, now)
			if not ok then core.report("perk_dots", "bleeding request", e) end
		end
		if chain_st.ticks > 0 then
			local ok, e = pcall(chain_flush, now)
			if not ok then core.report("perk_dots", "Chain request", e) end
		end
		if waiting[1] then settle_waiting(now) end
		if dots[1] then tick_dots(now) end
	end
	if now >= next_sweep then
		next_sweep = now + SWEEP_MS
		local ok, e = pcall(sweep, now)
		if not ok then core.report("perk_dots", "sweep", e) end
	end
end

local function status()
	return string.format("bleeding: asked %d, here %d (ticks %d, kills %d, running %d, waiting for a hit %d, no hit of his %d) "
		.. "| Chain: asked %d, healed %d (no companion here %d) | Ball: asked %d, own kicks held %d, kicked here %d | refused %d",
		st.bleeds_out, st.bleeds, st.ticks, st.kills, #dots, #waiting, st.no_hit, st.heals_out, st.heals, st.heals_none,
		st.kicks_out, st.kicks_held, st.kicks, st.refused)
end

-- Tests and coop_status: what runs now.
function _state()
	local n = #full_bleeds
	for _ in pairs(pending) do n = n + 1 end
	return { dots = #dots, pending = n, waiting = #waiting }
end

-- on_game_start never throws (axr_main runs every script's on_game_start in one unprotected loop).
local started = false
function on_game_start()
	if started or not api then return end
	started = true
	local pba = core.mod("perk_based_artefacts")
	if not pba then return end
	local ab = core.mod("coop_mods_perk_abilities")
	if not (ab and core.fn(ab, "cmd") and core.fn(ab, "serve")) then
		log("! no ability commands (coop_mods_perk_abilities): bleeding, heal and kick stay the mod's own")
		return
	end
	abil = ab
	core.install("perk_dots", "bleed", function()
		for _, name in ipairs({ "artefact_on_monster_before_hit_functions", "artefact_on_npc_before_hit_functions" }) do
			core.wrap(pba[name], "af_repei", "perk_based_artefacts." .. name .. ".af_repei:coop_bleed", thistle)
		end
		ab.serve("bleed", { items = { af_repei = true }, target = true, range = BLEED_RANGE, every = BLEED_MIN_MS,
			apply = bleed_apply })
	end)
	core.install("perk_dots", "chain", function()
		core.wrap(pba.artefact_on_update_functions, "af_chelust", "perk_based_artefacts.af_chelust:coop_heal", chain)
		ab.serve("chain", { items = { af_chelust = true }, floor = 500, every = CHAIN_MS - 500, apply = chain_apply })
	end)
	core.install("perk_dots", "ball", function()
		core.wrap(pba.artefact_on_key_press_functions, "af_ball", "perk_based_artefacts.af_ball:coop_kick", ball)
		ab.serve("ball", { items = { af_ball = true }, target = true, range = BALL_RANGE, floor = 1500, every = 1500,
			apply = ball_apply })
	end)
	core.install("perk_dots", "callbacks", function()
		RegisterScriptCallback("actor_on_update", update)
		RegisterScriptCallback("monster_on_before_hit", own_kick)
		RegisterScriptCallback("npc_on_before_hit", own_kick)
		RegisterScriptCallback("monster_on_before_hit", note_hit)
		RegisterScriptCallback("npc_on_before_hit", note_hit)
	end)
	core.install("perk_dots", "status", function() core.status_line("perk_dots", status) end)
end
